            "review_title": "Review at Laos Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Naoma M\nSeoul, South Korea2 contributions\n0\nThe best Laos cuisine in Hanoi!\nNov 2025 • Friends\nLaos food is similar to Thai food, but much better than most Thai restaurants in Hanoi. You can also enjoy Laos beer, and there is a variety of compact and delicious Asian dishes prepared so you can choose to taste.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Korean\nShow original\nWritten November 13, 2025",
